import Link from 'next/link'; import {notFound} from 'next/navigation'; import {getPlayerById,getPlayers} from '@/services/playerService'; import {getMatches} from '@/services/matchService'; import {calculatePlayerStats} from '@/utils/calculatePlayerStats'; import {calculateAge} from '@/utils/calculateAge'; import {formatDate} from '@/utils/formatDate';
export function generateStaticParams(){return getPlayers().map(p=>({playerId:p.playerId}))}
export default async function PlayerDetail({params}:{params:Promise<{playerId:string}>}){const {playerId}=await params,player=getPlayerById(playerId);if(!player)notFound();const matches=getMatches(),stats=calculatePlayerStats(matches,playerId),played=matches.filter(m=>m.startingPlayers.some(p=>p.playerId===playerId)||m.substitutions.some(s=>s.playerInId===playerId));return <><section className="profile"><div className="profile-number">{player.number}</div><div className="profile-copy"><p className="eyebrow">{player.position} · KASHIMA ANTLERS</p><h1>{player.name}</h1><p>{player.nameEn}</p></div></section><div className="two-col"><section className="panel"><h2>プロフィール</h2><dl className="details"><div><dt>生年月日</dt><dd>{formatDate(player.dateOfBirth)}（{calculateAge(player.dateOfBirth)}歳）</dd></div><div><dt>身長 / 体重</dt><dd>{player.height}cm / {player.weight}kg</dd></div><div><dt>利き足</dt><dd>{{RIGHT:'右足',LEFT:'左足',BOTH:'両足',UNKNOWN:'不明'}[player.preferredFoot]}</dd></div><div><dt>国籍</dt><dd>{player.nationality}</dd></div></dl></section><section><h2>2026 成績</h2><div className="stat-grid compact">{[['出場',stats.appearances],['先発',stats.starts],['得点',stats.goals],['アシスト',stats.assists]].map(([l,v])=><div className="stat" key={l}><strong>{v}</strong><span>{l}</span></div>)}</div></section></div><section><h2>出場試合</h2>{played.length?<div className="simple-list">{played.map(m=><Link href={`/matches/${m.matchId}`} key={m.matchId}><span>{formatDate(m.date)} · {m.round}</span><strong>vs {m.opponent.name}　→</strong></Link>)}</div>:<p className="empty">出場試合はありません</p>}</section></>}
